## Regression Testing Priority

When time is limited, prioritize these tests based on what was changed:

### High Priority (Always Run)
- Steps 1-2: App startup and basic functionality
- Steps 5: Undo system works
- Steps 32: Data persists across restarts

### Medium Priority (Run if UI Changed)
- Steps 14-15: Sidebar and page management
- Steps 16-17: Formatting toolbar
- Steps 33-53: Canvas and block operations

### Low Priority (Run if Specific Feature Changed)
- Steps 59-70: Table-specific features
- Steps 71-74: Template features
- Steps 79-80: Auto-fit and resize features
